<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40085" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quĕrĭmōnĭa</span></b> ,
		ae, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				complaint</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">querimoniae de injuriis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 3, 57, § 132</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">novo querimoniae genere uti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 1, 9</span></i>
			, § 24; <i><span class="en">id. Cat. 1, 11, 27</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nulla inter eos querimonia intercessit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Nep.
					Att. 17, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tristes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 3, 24, 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">malae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 13, 19</span></i>
			: versibus impariter junctis querimonia primum inclusa est.
				<i><span class="en">id. A. P.
				75</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">querimonias aut gemitus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					1, 26, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
